<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-KEY MATCH STATISTICS OF ENGLAND V BRAZIL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KEY MATCH STATISTICS OF ENGLAND V BRAZIL.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil and England both had four</p>
<p>shots on target in their Tournoi de France match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Although Brazil only won 1-0, they forced 15 corners to</p>
<p>England's two.</p>
<p>Statistics supplied by tournament organisers:</p>
<p>			Brazil		 England</p>
<p> Goals		 1			  0</p>
<p> Goal Attempts     4			  4</p>
<p> Shots wide	  4			  7</p>
<p> Corners	    15			  2</p>
<p> Free kicks	 17			 13</p>
<p> Offsides	    2			  2</p>
</text>
